author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: "Real SDK CLI and MCP receipts distinguish absent, inapplicable and compliant contracts; opt-in contract requirement fails after policy removal; bounded counts retain coverage evidence."
goal: project management = context management
objective: Make governance contracts independently understandable and executable across all transports
value: Reduce agent retry cost while preserving declared workspace guarantees
parent: pm-33cw
repro_steps: "https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1231"
resolution: "Expose declared, state-eligible and applicable requirements plus governed-item counts; compose strict contract presence through existing assurance primitives."
